{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lNnQHwHqH61792684207.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共中央政治局委員、外長王毅，會見訪華的剛果共和國外長邦達。</p><p></p><p>兩人在釣魚台國賓館會談，王毅指，單邊主義、保護主義盛行，當前聯合國作用遭遇挑戰，中方支持非洲國家在國際舞台發揮更大作用，願同非方一道堅定維護發展中國家的正當權益。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BJ.WANG-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hedx1KW1Ir1792684351.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>邦達指全球南方有必要加強團結合作，願同中方共同籌備好中非合作論壇，新一屆部長級會議，推動非中關係實現新的更大發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:39.126266+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:32.849563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:09.950100+00:00","content_hash":"fa19a1341612ebed31fae932a5a08e8848e4647c8711e2b812f7f93a4291ef5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:39.126266+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}